meta {
  name: 06. Archive Group (Owner)
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/groups/{{groupId}}/archive
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

vars:pre-request {
  groupId: 3
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
  forwardAuthorizationHeader: false
}

docs {
  ## Method, Endpoint, and Auth

  `POST /api/v1/groups/:groupID/archive` — Group owner or site admin; Bearer access token required.

  ## Description

  Moves ACTIVE to SETTLING and records archived_at. Expenses, polls and draws become read-only, but settlement creation/confirm/reject/pending-delete remain allowed. CLOSED cannot be reopened. Repeating archive on SETTLING is harmless.

  ## Request

  ### Path Parameters

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `groupID` | `integer` | Yes | Positive group ID. |

  ### Headers

  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `Authorization` | `string` | Yes | `Bearer <access-token>` |

  ## Response

  **`200 OK`**
  ```json
  {"success": true, "data": {"message": "group archived successfully"}}
  ```

  ## Errors

  - `409 GROUP_STATUS_TRANSITION` — A `CLOSED` group cannot move to `SETTLING`.

  - `400 GROUP_INVALID_ID` — `groupID` is not a positive integer.
  - `401 MISSING_TOKEN` — Access token is missing or invalid.
  - `403 GROUP_FORBIDDEN` — Requester is neither the owner nor an admin.
  - `404 GROUP_NOT_FOUND` — Group does not exist or was deleted.
}
